====================================================
  Harness Curator — schedule installer
====================================================

Target OS:  Linux
Curator:    <SCRIPTS>/curate
Logfile:    <HOME>/.local/state/crewrig/harness-curator.log

Wrote: <HOME>/.config/systemd/user/io.crewrig.harness-curator.service
Wrote: <HOME>/.config/systemd/user/io.crewrig.harness-curator.timer
Enabled and scheduled: io.crewrig.harness-curator.timer
Note: a crontab entry from an earlier version (marker "# crewrig-harness-curator") is not removed by this command; remove it manually with "crontab -e".

Reactive trigger (run manually when a severity:high friction is filed):
    node <SCRIPTS>/curate --apply --dedup --max-issues 5
